  "title": "The Thieno[2,3‐<i>c</i>]pyridine Reissert Compound",
  "abstract": "AbstractThieno[2,3‐c]pyridine has been converted to 6‐benzoyl‐ and 6‐carbethoxy‐7‐cyano‐6,7‐dihydrothieno[2,3‐c]‐pyridine. Alkylation, condensation, Michael addition, and cyclo addition reactions of these Reissert type compounds have been carried out.",
